  "remarks": "Has a prosthetic right leg.Member of Taliban Supreme Council as of mid-2013, acted as deputy of Mullah Mohammed Omar in Mar. 2010. Believed to be in Afghanistan/Pakistan border area. Belongs to Achekzai tribe. Review pursuant to Security Council Resolution 1822 (2008) was concluded on 23 Jul. 2010. Deceased as of 9 February 2016. INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice web link: https://www.interpol. int/en/notice/search/un/1427431",
